From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Nikolajs Agafonovs <nikolajs.agafonovs@gmail.com>
Date: Fri, 23 Oct 2026 16:30:28 +0300
Subject: [PATCH] tests: the driver options of the kernel and busybox builds

158_link_group: archives with circular references inside
-Wl,--start-group/--end-group are rescanned (fix 53 of the
tinycc-os-kernel project); 159_depfile: -Wp,-MMD,<file> and -E -MMD write
the dependency file (fixes 3, 68); 160_asm_offsets: -S writes the asm
statements as text, from which Kbuild generates asm-offsets.h (fix 58).
---
 tests/tests2/158_link_group.c       | 24 ++++++++++++++++++++++++
 tests/tests2/158_link_group.expect  |  1 +
 tests/tests2/159_depfile.c          |  7 +++++++
